                        "sense_id": "2037dd18-bdd1-3d04-9aca-646ed8aa6ce0",
                        "entry_id": "bca7d561-ead4-33b5-9ff9-879a6914e063",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A title accorded to the progenitor of mankind, first king to rule this earth, who saves mankind from the universal flood."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Hinduism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8c7aa29-a7bc-4060-9325-088388acb465",
                                "sense_id": "2037dd18-bdd1-3d04-9aca-646ed8aa6ce0",
                                "text": "Agni is the one who is introduced by Manu, who is kindled by Manu; one requests him to rule at the present sacrifice, as he had done it for Manu, when he \"offered the first oblation, with kindled fire, with his (attentive) heart and soul, along with the seven priests\" to the gods (X, 63, 7)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a5ec7bbb-10d9-3ee3-a7c8-6a94e30c24e5",
                        "entry_id": "bca7d561-ead4-33b5-9ff9-879a6914e063",
